  "planning_notes": [
    "Board is Arduino Uno (arduino:avr:uno). D0/D1 are reserved for Serial; no pin overrides were supplied.",
    "Three occupancy sensors are implemented as digital inputs on D2, D3, D7 exactly as specified; their electrical polarity (active-high vs active-low) is assumed to be already represented by the model using the captured boolean meaning (no active-low inversion performed here).",
    "TM1637 uses CLK=D4 and DIO=D5 and displays the current occupied layer count (0..3).",
    "Buzzer is tone_output on D6; LED indicator is digital_output on D13.",
    "Exact serial command set, reset behavior, per-layer empty-time querying, and restock timeout configuration are handled in the SysML model; this proposal only declares the required IO and serial reporting group outputs.",
    "No serial receive interface request was added because no explicit ASCII command token mapping or baud-consistent input behavior was provided in the requirements."
